-font-icon-svg e-eicon-star" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M450 75L338 312 88 350C46 354 25 417 58 450L238 633 196 896C188 942 238 975 275 954L500 837 725 954C767 975 813 942 804 896L763 633 942 450C975 417 954 358 913 350L663 312 550 75C529 33 471 33 450 75Z"></path></svg></div><div class="e-icon-wrapper e-icon-unmarked"> <svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-star" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M450 75L338 312 88 350C46 354 25 417 58 450L238 633 196 896C188 942 238 975 275 954L500 837 725 954C767 975 813 942 804 896L763 633 942 450C975 417 954 358 913 350L663 312 550 75C529 33 471 33 450 75Z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3db9889f feedback-text elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3db9889f" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> Clients consistently describe Invigorate Behavioral Health as a life-changing environment where compassionate staff offer both clinical and emotional support. From the first call to ongoing care, multiple reviewers highlight tailored treatment plans, skilled medical teams, and heartfelt guidance. Many mention forming lifelong friendships, feeling safe, and learning about themselves in a nurturing setting. Reviewers also note that the staff go above and beyond to address unique needs—whether it’s coordinating immediate medical attention, advocating for personal issues, or helping clients overcome fears about entering treatment. Across every story, Invigorate emerges as a place that fosters genuine connection and renewed hope, encouraging personal growth and transformation on the path to lasting recovery.</div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eade4d8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="eade4d8" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-74e3566a elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-testimonial" data-id="74e3566a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-testimonial.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div  class="elementskit-testimonial-slider ekit_testimonial_style_6 arrow_inside " data-config="{&quot;rtl&quot;:false,&quot;arrows&quot;:true,&quot;dots&quot;:false,&quot;pauseOnHover&quot;:true,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;speed&quot;:1000,&quot;slidesPerGroup&quot;:1,&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;loop&quot;:false,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:15,&quot;breakpoints&quot;:{&quot;320&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;slidesPerGroup&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:10},&quot;768&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:2,&quot;slidesPerGroup&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:10},&quot;1024&quot;:{&quot;slidesPerView&quot;:1,&quot;slidesPerGroup&quot;:1,&quot;spaceBetween&quot;:15}}}"><div class="ekit-main-swiper swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiper-slide-inner"><div class="elementskit-single-testimonial-slider elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style-three  elementor-repeater-item-a6e477e" ><div class="elementskit-watermark-icon elementskit-icon-content  commentor-badge "> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-quote"></i></div><div class="elementskit-commentor-bio "><div class="elementkit-commentor-details"><div class="elementskit-commentor-image ekit-testimonial--avatar"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="70" height="70" src="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp 512w, /assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google-300x300.webp 300w, /assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementskit-profile-info"> <strong class="elementskit-author-name">Patrick</strong></div><div class="elementskit-commentor-content"><ul class="elementskit-stars"><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li></ul><p>My time at Invigorate Behavioral Health was most definitely a five-star experience. It was, in fact, life-changing.The recovery doctors, therapists, psychiatrists, group leaders, and technicians are soulfully skilled. Participating in their groups and one-on-one sessions always proved helpful and inward-seeking.In addition, I made lifelong friendships that I'll cherish forever. We took "field trips" to see some of the area's monuments on several occasions, which were very enjoyable.What was clear from the moment I made my first call to the end of my 30 days of treatment was that Invigorate puts YOU first and tailors your journey to your needs.Make that call to Invigorate Behavioral Health. It may just save your life, too!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiper-slide-inner"><div class="elementskit-single-testimonial-slider elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style-three  elementor-repeater-item-6a7d5c1" ><div class="elementskit-watermark-icon elementskit-icon-content  commentor-badge "> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-quote"></i></div><div class="elementskit-commentor-bio "><div class="elementkit-commentor-details"><div class="elementskit-commentor-image ekit-testimonial--avatar"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="70" height="70" src="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp 512w, /assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google-300x300.webp 300w, /assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google-150x150.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementskit-profile-info"> <strong class="elementskit-author-name">Dylon</strong></div><div class="elementskit-commentor-content"><ul class="elementskit-stars"><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li></ul><p>Invigorate definitely saved me from a difficult situation. I was down to literally nothing and finally decided to seek help one morning. I contacted a facility near home but did not get accepted. No more than 20 minutes later Darrin had contacted me. He informed me about the program and was on my side when it came to getting the help I was looking for. Staff immediately took me in very kindly, also helped me medically as I needed to see a doctor right away. Upon getting back to the facility feeling much better I was fully admitted to the program and later met with Shane, my case manager. He helped me get set up with everyone I needed to talk to to get through everything with ease. My time spent there was great. The fellow clients, the staff, food the resources. Everything was set up up perfect. Highly recommend this program to any one in need. My time was well spent.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiper-slide-inner"><div class="elementskit-single-testimonial-slider elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style elementskit-testimonial-slider-block-style-three  elementor-repeater-item-207854d" ><div class="elementskit-watermark-icon elementskit-icon-content  commentor-badge "> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-quote"></i></div><div class="elementskit-commentor-bio "><div class="elementkit-commentor-details"><div class="elementskit-commentor-image ekit-testimonial--avatar"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="70" height="70" src="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="/assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google.webp 512w, /assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/google-300x300.webp 3