10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li><li><a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 576 512"><path d="M316.9 18C311.6 7 300.4 0 288.1 0s-23.4 7-28.8 18L195 150.3 51.4 171.5c-12 1.8-22 10.2-25.7 21.7s-.7 24.2 7.9 32.7L137.8 329 113.2 474.7c-2 12 3 24.2 12.9 31.3s23 8 33.8 2.3l128.3-68.5 128.3 68.5c10.8 5.7 23.9 4.9 33.8-2.3s14.9-19.3 12.9-31.3L438.5 329 542.7 225.9c8.6-8.5 11.7-21.2 7.9-32.7s-13.7-19.9-25.7-21.7L381.2 150.3 316.9 18z" /></svg></a></li></ul><p>It has helped me greatly this facility has made it easier to focus on my recovery. The staff here have genuine love and support towards the clients. If you are feeling afraid to make that decision to come to treatment, don’t be they accommodate you. Reassure you that the way you are feeling are indeed valid. That everything will be alright. It’s a great place to be it has helped me start my life all over again. And I truly do feel better with being here. So give it a try and let your new improved life unfold.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-navigation-button swiper-button-prev"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-chevron-left"></i></div><div class="swiper-navigation-button swiper-button-next"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-chevron-right"></i></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-166ad629 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="166ad629" data-element_type="container" id="verifyInsurance"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4983a3d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4983a3d5" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-22617eff animated-fast elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="22617eff" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp